<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><img src="2602.20300v1/plots/kde_psafe_by_class.png" id="A7.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/175;" width="476" height="175" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><img src="2602.20300v1/plots/kde_pborder_by_class.png" id="A7.F14.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/175;" width="476" height="175" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><img src="2602.20300v1/plots/kde_prisky_by_class.png" id="A7.F14.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/175;" width="476" height="175" alt="Refer to caption"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span><span id="A7.F14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Per-class probability KDEs.</span>
KDEs of model-predicted <math id="A7.F14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(\text{Safe})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Safe</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(\text{Safe})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.F14.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(\text{Borderline})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Borderline</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(\text{Borderline})</annotation></semantics></math>,
and <math id="A7.F14.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(\text{Risky})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>Risky</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(\text{Risky})</annotation></semantics></math> grouped by empirical class labels.</figcaption>
</figure>
