<span id="A7.T7.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">"How does reinforcement learning work?" (6 tokens)</span>
</span></td></tr>
