<td id="A7.T7.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">"What about that one?" (Unclear reference)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">Clause Complexity</td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Measures the presence of multiple subordinate clauses</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">"While I was walking home, I saw a cat that looked just like my friend’s."</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">Dependency Tree Depth</td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Depth of the query’s syntactic dependency tree.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">"Describe the structure of a sentence that contains multiple levels of embedding." (Depth: 7)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T7.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T7.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">Parse Tree Height</td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
