</span></td>
<td id="A7.T7.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T7.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">"Analyze a sentence with nested relative clauses." (Height: 4)</span>
</span></td></tr>
