<span id="A7.T8.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Who was the guitarist for the English Rock band who Terry Kirkbride performed live in the studio with?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The question contains an anaphoric reference (‘the English Rock band’) without clear contextual information.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✗</td>
