<span id="A7.T8.2.13.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.13.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is an organism at the top of the food chain called?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.13.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.13.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.13.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The phrase ‘apex predator’ is well known and lacks rare words.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
