<span id="A7.T8.2.14.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.14.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Which is not an inherited trait in humans?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.14.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.14.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.14.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The presence of ‘not’ reverses the expectation of the query.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✗</td>
