<span id="A7.T8.2.15.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.15.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Along with Walt Disney, who created Oswald the Lucky Rabbit?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.15.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.15.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.2.15.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The question is affirmative without negation.</span>
