<span id="A7.T8.2.19.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Some plants can detect increased levels of what when reflected from leaves of encroaching neighbors?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T8.2.19.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
