<span id="A7.T9.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Polysemous Words</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✓</td>
