<span id="A7.T9.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Who supervised the sting operation that implicated Evelyn Dawn Knight?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The word ‘supervised’ could have different meanings but in this context refers to oversight.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✗</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Which string instrument often played the basso continuo parts?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The terms ‘string instrument’ and ‘basso continuo’ are not polysemous in this context.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Subjectivity</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✓</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is a criticism of other streaming services?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The query invites subjective responses based on personal opinions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">✗</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
